            "review_title": "Review at Cà-rem",
            "review_text": "Kory N\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nDecent Thai coconut ice cream but way better at The Coconut in Binh Thanh district\nApr 2018 • Couples\nThis shop only serves Thai coconut ice cream which was decent for the price but we prefer The Coconut shop in Binh Thanh district. The Coconut shop tasted fresher and creamier and they also have many other ice cream and drink options to select from. Great when going with a group. Price was only 28k per item. One of the owner is from California and speaks fluent English.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 19, 2018",
