            "review_text": "msanseb\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam13 contributions\n1\nThai style ice cream in a coconut with all the trimmings $!.50 5mins ride from backpacker area\nJan 2016 • Couples\nMy Vietnamese girlfriend took me here. To be honest I'm not blown away by VN cuisine even after 2 years here. However this was a treat. Beautiful creamy ice cream served with interesting side flavourings and VN mystery crunchy bits. Served in half a coconut with a glass of fresh coconut milk. I've been back many times now and it's consistantly good. Always busy with young Viets, a REAL TREAT. i WISH i HAD FOUND IT SOONER.\n\nopen 3.30pm to 10.30pm 30k vnd!!!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 28, 2016",
